  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Members confronting Fang Yuan and Bai Ning Bing on San Cha Mountain call themselves Nan mountain’s Ten Tyrants. Only their boss among the Ten Tyrants is at rank four middle stage. Nearby righteous Gu Masters who were about to intervene shrink back when they hear the Ten Tyrants name.",
