      "mentions": [
        "char_tyrant_heng_mei"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Bai Ning Bing recalls hearing that Tyrant Heng Mei is cruel, cultivates strength path, likes to eat little children’s flesh, and has spread fear over Nanshan. Narration states Tyrant Heng Mei commanded the other nine members of Ten Tyrants and had lorded over Nan mountain for many years with deep foundations.",
